                <p rendition="#center">Note.</p>
                <p>In case the Arbitrators should think it worth while to study the subject
                    attentively, we refer them to the following documents, which clearly prove the
                    spontaneous activity of the Executive at all times to prevent equipments and
                    expeditions in contravention of the law of nations, attempted in the ports of
                    the United States:</p>
